insert into pride_values (slug, name, one_liner, we_will, selection_indicators) values ('pride', 'Pride', 'We take pride in ourselves, our school and our community.', ARRAY['take pride in our school, our community and all that we do.','represent our school with honour and respect.','wear a clean and well presented school uniform.','celebrate our own and other''s achievements.','respect the school and learning environment.'], ARRAY['A character takes pride in their work, identity, culture, or community.','A character represents their family, community, or group with honour.','A character celebrates their own or another''s achievement.','A character shows ownership and respect for shared spaces or belongings.']);
insert into pride_values (slug, name, one_liner, we_will, selection_indicators) values ('respect', 'Respect', 'We respect ourselves, our school and each other, and understand the importance of treating others with compassion, care and courtesy.', ARRAY['treat others with compassion, care and fairness.','value and celebrate people''s differences.','be a caring and courteous friend.','use kind words and be polite in all interactions.','include others in the classroom and in the yard.','show care and concern for self, others and school property.'], ARRAY['A character treats another with compassion, care, or fairness — especially across difference.','A character values or celebrates someone who is different from them.','A character actively includes someone who is excluded.','A character shows care and concern for others'' wellbeing.','A character uses kindness or courtesy in a meaningful way.']);
insert into pride_values (slug, name, one_liner, we_will, selection_indicators) values ('integrity', 'Integrity', 'We model and demonstrate integrity by being honest, true and fair in all interactions.', ARRAY['make positive choices even when no one is watching.','be honest, true and fair.','take responsibility for actions and accept consequences.','follow our school values and expectations.','represent the school in all situations with positivity and pride.','be safe and considerate.'], ARRAY['A character makes an honest or ethical choice when it would be easier not to.','A character does the right thing even when no one is watching.','A character takes responsibility for a mistake or wrong action and accepts the consequence.','A character is faced with a moral dilemma and chooses honesty or fairness.']);
insert into pride_values (slug, name, one_liner, we_will, selection_indicators) values ('determination', 'Determination', 'We show determination by using a growth mindset to overcome challenges, and use new and innovative ways to achieve our personal best.', ARRAY['try our best and find new ways to reach personal goals.','be resilient and bounce back from mistakes and setbacks.','use growth mindset skills and strategies to overcome challenges.','be positive and enthusiastic about learning.','strive for excellence but not perfection.'], ARRAY['A character persists in the face of difficulty, failure, or setback.','A character bounces back after a loss, injury, or mistake.','A character finds a new way to solve a problem when the first attempt fails.','A character''s growth mindset or refusal to give up drives the story forward.']);
insert into pride_values (slug, name, one_liner, we_will, selection_indicators) values ('excellence', 'Excellence', 'We strive for excellence, aiming to be the very best we can be by setting goals and striving to gain new knowledge.', ARRAY['aim high to be the best version of ourselves.','be positive and enthusiastic about learning.','come ready to engage in learning.','set challenging learning goals.','be a positive example to others.','strive to learn and gain new knowledge.'], ARRAY['A character sets a high personal standard and works toward it.','A character pursues knowledge, skill, or growth with enthusiasm.','A character becomes a role model or positive example to others through their efforts.','A character strives to be their best self rather than simply good enough.']);
insert into inquiry_lenses (slug, name, description, selection_indicators) values ('social_responsibility', 'Social Responsibility', 'Students will investigate local and global communities and consider the challenges and opportunities associated with living in a diverse society. This lens is about social organisation and the ways in which people are connected to and have responsibility for each other. Students will explore the concept of change, discovering ways in which the past has made us who we are and how and why society changes over time. Students will develop citizenship by building skills for active involvement in their community.', ARRAY['The text explores how people are connected to or responsible for each other.','The text depicts community, diversity, or what it means to belong.','The text explores fairness, justice, or the challenges of living in society.','The text examines how the past shapes identity or how communities change over time.','The text raises questions about citizenship, rights, or active participation in community life.']);
insert into inquiry_lenses (slug, name, description, selection_indicators) values ('environmental_sustainability', 'Environmental Sustainability', 'Students will investigate our dependence on a healthy natural environment. Investigations focus on the diversity and richness of the natural environment and the ways in which humans use and interact with the environment. Importantly, this lens emphasises the need to care for and live responsibly with the environment - at a local, national and global level.', ARRAY['The text explores the natural environment — its diversity, richness, or fragility.','The text depicts the relationship between humans and the natural world.','The text raises questions about caring for, protecting, or living responsibly with the environment.','The text addresses environmental challenges at a local, national, or global scale.','The text explores what it means to depend on and coexist with nature.']);
insert into inquiry_lenses (slug, name, description, selection_indicators) values ('the_physical_world', 'The Physical World', 'Students will investigate the systems that govern physical phenomena in both the natural and built environment. They will become more aware of how science can help us explain the way the world works and the impact of science and technology on our lives. As students work through scientific problem solving, experimenting and gathering data, they become aware of the powerful role that design, technology and scientific thinking have in the world. This lens also promotes the processes used to innovate, create, make and evaluate.', ARRAY['The text engages with science, technology, engineering, or design.','The text explores how the physical or built world works.','The text features problem solving, experimentation, invention, or innovation.','The text raises questions about the role of science and technology in our lives.','The text depicts processes of making, creating, or evaluating in a physical or technological context.']);
insert into inquiry_lenses (slug, name, description, selection_indicators) values ('identity_creativity_wellbeing', 'Identity, Creativity and Wellbeing', 'Students will investigate their uniqueness, talents and passions, and inquire into how to best nurture themselves - physically, emotionally, mentally and spiritually. This lens focuses on how we can work towards our potential, develop resilience, build healthy relationships and make wise choices. It fosters self-expression, resilience and creativity and explores how we change and grow. This lens is also about expressions through the arts and how this in turn helps us communicate with others.', ARRAY['The text explores identity, self-discovery, or what makes someone who they are.','The text depicts a character developing resilience, working through emotions, or growing as a person.','The text explores creativity, self-expression, or the arts as a way of communicating.','The text raises questions about wellbeing — physical, emotional, mental, or relational.','The text explores building healthy relationships or making wise choices.','The text follows a character changing, growing, or discovering their potential.']);
